sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/86.html\">Sûre At-Taariq</a> › Âyet 7</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre At-Taariq 86:7</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَخْرُجُ مِن بَيْنِ الصُّلْبِ وَالتَّرَائِبِ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Bu su, bel ile kaburga kemikleri arasından çıkar.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والأول أظهر؛ لأنه سبحانه قال: {يخرج من بين الصلب والترائب} [الطارق: 7] ولم يقل يخرج من الصلب والترائب فلا بد أن يكون ماء الرجل خارجا من بين هذين المختلفين<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/113</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «المراد بها ترائبه أيضا، وهي عظام الصدر ما بين الترقوة إلى الثندوة»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/113</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">رجّح غيره</span> «المراد ترائب المرأة»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/113</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s86a7\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/86-4.html\">Önceki âyet (86:4)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/86-8.html\">Sonraki âyet (86:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/86-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: At-Taariq 86:8 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Şüphesiz Allah’ın onu, öldükten sonra tekrar diriltmeye de gücü yeter.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/86-8.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: At-Taariq 86:8 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Şüphesiz Allah’ın onu, öldükten sonra tekrar diriltmeye de gücü yeter.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre At-Taariq\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/86.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 8\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/86-8.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/86.html\">Sûre At-Taariq</a> › Âyet 8</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre At-Taariq 86:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِ لَقَادِرٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Şüphesiz Allah’ın onu, öldükten sonra tekrar diriltmeye de gücü yeter.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">الصحيح أن الضمير يرجع على الإنسان، أي إن الله على رده إليه لقادر يوم القيامة<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/113</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وطريقة القرآن - وهي الاستدلال بالمبدإ والنشأة الأولى على المعاد والرجوع إليه - وأيضا فإنه قيده بالظرف، وهو {يوم تبلى السرائر} [الطارق: 9]<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/113</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">من قال</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «إن الضمير يرجع على الماء أي أن الله على رجعه في الإحليل أو في الصدر أو حبسه عن الخروج لقادر»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/113</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s86a8\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/86-7.html\">Önceki âyet (86:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/86.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Sûre At-Taariq — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tefsiri: Sûre At-Taariq — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;in sözleriyle Kur&#x27;an&#x27;ın manaları\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/86.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/86.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/86.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/86.html\">\n<link rel=\"alt